    <div class="dash-col">
      <p>  <p>Returns a <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Category:LSL_Integer/bit_field" target="_blank">bit field</a> (an <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Integer" target="_blank">integer</a>) of the requested permission <b>category</b> for the object containing this script.</p>
</p>
